contentText:
Taylor Swift took home the VMAs&#8217; most coveted prize of the night at the Sunday (Sept. 27) awards, winning video of the year for The Life of a Showgirl single &#8220;The Fate of Ophelia,&#8221; and shouted out the &#8220;ultimate showgirl,&#8221; Dolly Parton , in her speech.

